
                       geant4-11-04-ref-02
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o First modifications to EM classes for preparing implementation of parallel
   initialisation of EM physics.
 o In hadronic de_excitation model, limit energy non-conservation to 0.5 MeV
   in G4UnstableFragmentBreakUp.
 o Updated data set G4EMLOW-8.9.
 
---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(o)  Fixes included in patch release 11.4.1

Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

cmake                                            cmake-V11-04-01
-----
- Use CMake 3.16-3.19 compatible construction of interface libraries.        (o)
  Addresses problem report #2700.
  Fixed logic error in construction of link interface to such interface
  libraries that resulted in empty target creation/export.
- Updated data set G4EMLOW-8.9.

externals
---------
- g4tools (g4tools-V11-04-07)
  o Removed obsolete 'rtausmef' RNG; C++ Standard Library provides sufficient
    quality and distributions for use within tools itself.
  o Removed unused 'carray' header; simplified 'text_valop' to allow removal
    of 'valop' and 'valop2sg'.
  o In tools/sg/group, added takeover_nodes() method to transfer nodes from
    another group.
  o In toolx/sg/text_freetype_marker, override char_height_touched() to properly
    handle the field 'height'.
  o Fixed compilation warning for implicit type conversion on macOS/XCode.

geometry/magneticfield                           field-V11-04-00
----------------------
- Fixed reported Coverity defect for restoring original stream precision     (o)
  in G4FieldManager::ReportBadEpsilonValue().

global                                           global-V11-04-04
