physics_lists
-------------
- constructors/electromagnetic (phys-ctor-em-V11-04-05)
  o G4EmStandardPhysics_option4: added possibility to use external dEdx      (o)
    tables for ions, done through substitution of the G4LindhardSorencenIonModel
    model class by G4IonParameterisedModel. Addressing problem report #2703.
  o G4EmDNAPhysics, G4EmDNAPhysics_option2, G4EmDNAPhysics_option4,
    G4EmDNAPhysics_option6, G4EmDNAPhysics_option8, G4EmDNABuilder,
    G4EmDNAPhysicsActivator: added deuteron to the list of DNA particles using
    track structure Rudd model of ionisation at low-energy.

processes/electromagnetic
-------------------------
- dna (emdna-V11-04-02)
  o G4DNARuddIonisationDynamicModel: fixed max energy transfer.
  o G4DNARuddIonisationDynamicModel, G4DNARuddIonisationExtendedModel: at
    initialisation, changed the order of definition of type of charged
    particle to enable deuteron ionisation in DNA.
  o G4DNAIonisation: use EM parameters to define energy limits for a model.
  o G4DNAElastic: use correct type of ions.
- muons (emmuons-V11-04-02)
  o G4EnergyLossForExtrapolator: in order to avoid data race in the MT mode,
    implemented backward propagation only for materials used in geometry,
    and ignore base material approach.
  o G4EnergyLossForExtrapolator, G4TablesForExtrapolator: technical
    modifications daccording to changes in 'utils' module. No changes in
    Physics behavior.
  o Fixed compilation warnings for implicit type conversions on macOS/XCode.
- utils (emutils-V11-04-04)
  o Most classes are modified to prepare implementation of parallel
    initialisation of EM physics: computation of physics tables are performed
    using static utilities; tables and vector built during initialisation are
    stored in static area; processes for different particles may be initialized
    independently. Also some technical changes are done, like more use of const
    pointers and methods; improved debug printouts; removed old commented debug
    printouts; removed TABS; improved comments; removed unused headers.
    Results of 25 EM tests show full numerical agreement with the results of
    the 11.4 release.
  o G4LossTableBuilder: in order to avoid data race in backward propagator,
    added extra logical parameter to public methods; should not affect any
    existing application. 
  o Fixed compilation warnings for implicit type conversions on macOS/XCode.

