  o Fixed layout of G4fissionEvent class.
- models/inclxx (hadr-inclxx-V11-04-01)
  o In G4INCLCrossSectionsAntiparticles, corrected wrong formulae with       (o)
    isospins concerning the cross-sections N Nbar -> N Nbar + 2 pions.
  o In G4INCLNNToNSK2piChannel, fixed 'iso' condition.                       (o)
- models/nudex (hadr-nudex-V11-04-00)
  o Fixed reported Coverity defects in G4NuDEXPSF for avoiding unnecessary   (o)
